Harmony migration accounting toolkit

This toolkit links to and reuses data structures from:

- Harmony: https://github.com/harmony-one/harmony
- go-ethereum: https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum

Harmony and the copied/derived Harmony-compatible portions retain their
applicable copyright and GNU Lesser General Public License terms.

The repository pins exact dependency revisions in its setup script and snapshot
manifest so reviewers can rebuild the same software environment.
